title: Confronting the Nazis
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: (nts_r >= 10 and nazi_urgency > 1) and confronting_nazis_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed == 0
on-arrival: confronting_nazis_seen += 1; confronting_nazis_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
card-image: img/streetfighting2.png
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

# Forming the Iron Front

The Solidarists' strength is gaining, as shown by their recent election results and their violent presence in the streets. Their fascism threatens to plunge Russia once again into the abyss.

Many in our party are calling for urgent action. The "neo-defencist" faction, led by young socialists and Civil War veterans, have formed specifically around this cause. But many in all factions of the party are calling for action.

- @not_a_big_deal: The Solidarists' moment will pass. Let's not get too hasty.
- @economic_crisis
- @major_crisis: We must do something to confront the far-right.
- @iron_front


@not_a_big_deal
on-arrival: nazi_urgency -= 1; left_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 15
view-if: mierendorff_advisor = 0 and leber_advisor = 0 and schumacher_advisor = 0

The Solidarists are just another far-right movement that will die of its own contradictions sooner or later; we do not need to build a specific policy to combat them.

@economic_crisis
title: We must address the economic crisis first.
view-if: economic_plan == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1
go-to: crisis_program

@major_crisis
view-if: nazi_urgency < 5
on-arrival: nazi_urgency += 1; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5; neorevisionist_strength += 5

The Solidarists are one of the foremost threats to the Russian Republic. However, we are still formulating a strategy to confront them, and still trying to build up consensus within our party for action. Check back on this later.

@iron_front
title: Form the Red Banner!
subtitle: The Red Banner consists of the RSDRP, the trade unions, and the SF.
view-if: nazi_urgency >= 3 and iron_front_formed == 0
on-arrival: iron_front_formed = 1; radicalization += 1; nazi_urgency += 1; workers_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); left_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_strength += 5
achievement: eiserne_front

The Solidarists threat can no longer be ignored. We must build a new organization to confront them - the Red Banner - consisting of the RSDRP, Socialist Trade Unions, and the *Soyuz Fevralya*. Taking inspiration from the German *Iron Front*, we will adopt a new logo for our branding - the Three Arrows, pointing down towards the left.

What do the three arrows stand for?

- @unity: Unity, Activity, and Discipline.
- @anti: Opposition to Solidarism, Revolutionary Narodism, and Monarchism.
- @orgs: The RSDRP, Unions, and the SF.
- @wtb: Voitinsky, Martynov, and  of the WTB-Plan
- @all: All of the above.

@unity
go-to: if_end

@anti
go-to: if_end

@orgs
go-to: if_end

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted == 1
go-to: if_end

@all
go-to: if_end

@if_end

The Iron Front has given a new energy to our party.
